WEBVTT

00:02:58.746 --> 00:03:03.121
Robots using algorithms
to identify facial expressions

00:03:03.163 --> 00:03:04.538
can help children learn

00:03:04.579 --> 00:03:07.579
or provide lonely people
with a sense of companionship.

00:03:07.621 --> 00:03:10.496
Social media companies
are considering using algorithms

00:03:10.538 --> 00:03:15.579
to help prevent suicides by flagging posts
that contain specific words or phrases.

00:03:16.038 --> 00:03:19.788
And emotion recognition software
can help treat mental disorders

00:03:19.829 --> 00:03:24.538
or even provide people with low-cost
automated psychotherapy.

00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:26.871
Despite the potential benefits,

00:03:26.913 --> 00:03:30.288
the prospect of a massive network
automatically scanning our photos,